# Copy to `.env` for `alchemy dev`. Every API route but /api/health requires
# `Authorization: Bearer $API_TOKEN`. Use a long random value when deploying.
API_TOKEN=local-dev-token

# The model provider's key is NOT set here.
# - Deployed: `API_PROVIDER_KEY` in the account's Cloudflare Secrets Store
#   (`default_secrets_store`), set out of band. alchemy.run.ts only looks it up;
#   deploys never create, change or delete it.
# - Local: production Secrets Store values can't be read locally, so `pnpm dev`
#   runs `infisical run --env=dev -- alchemy dev`, which injects
#   `API_PROVIDER_KEY` from Infisical. Alchemy seeds it into the local Secrets
#   Store simulator only. Link the repo once with `infisical init`.

# OpenUI telemetry off (ADR-0006).
OPENUI_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1
